This adaptation preserves the core scroll-scrub engine and extends it for
MiniMax Code. Major modifications include:

- analysis and semantic chaptering for an existing complete video;
- reuse of one source video through videoStart/videoEnd chapter windows;
- shared media Blob caching, key-frame holds, and overlay timing controls;
- MiniMax Code image_synthesize, gen_videos, and website_deploy workflows;
- local media inspection, extraction, encoding, and seam-check helpers;
- browser QA for chapter boundaries, reverse and rapid scrolling, mobile, and
  reduced-motion behavior; and
- a rewritten Chinese workflow for complete-video and generated-media modes.

